    "title": "Weigand Marina boat ramps & slips close - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reilly Mahon Maren Ewertz No media credit provided. ,\n1 hours ago\nKNOX COUNTY , Neb. ( KCAU ) — As we get closer to summer and the boating season, restricted access will affect those who count on a marina in northeast Nebraska.\nThe ramps and slips at the marina at Lewis and Clark State Park are closed.\nStory continues below\nState officials are saying it is to allow for work on an upgrade project.\nA majority of the park’s amenities will still be open during the construction process.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
    "summary": "By Reilly Mahon Maren Ewertz No media credit provided. ( KCAU ) — As we get closer to summer and the boating season, restricted access will affect those who count on a marina in northeast Nebraska. The ramps and slips at the marina at Lewis and Clark State Park are closed. State officials are saying it is to allow for work on an upgrade project. A majority of the park’s amenities will still be open during the construction process.",
